      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ian%20Edwards\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ian Edwards</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ian L. Edwards was appointed President and Chief Executive Officer of AtkinsRéalis in October 2019. He joined the company in 2014 and has over 30 years of experience in the global engineering and construction industry.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jeff%20Bell\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jeff Bell</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jeff Bell was appointed Chief Financial Officer in April 2020. Prior to joining AtkinsRéalis, he was Group CFO at Centrica plc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Philip%20Hoare\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Philip Hoare</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Engineering Services</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Philip Hoare is President, Engineering Services, UK & Europe, Middle East and India. He joined Atkins in 1997 and has held several senior leadership positions.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Joe%20St.%20Julian\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Joe St. Julian</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President, Nuclear</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Joe St. Julian is President, Nuclear. He joined the company in 2022 from Worley, where he was Executive Vice President.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Andr%C3%A9e-Claude%20B%C3%A9rub%C3%A9\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Andrée-Claude Bérubé</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice-President and General Counsel</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Andrée-Claude Bérubé is Executive Vice-President and General Counsel. She joined the company in 2020 and was previously at Sherritt International.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mary-Ann%20Bell\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mary-Ann Bell</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Corporate director and former executive at Bell Aliant Regional Communications.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Par%C3%A9\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Paré</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Strategic Advisor at Fasken Martineau DuMoulin LLP.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ruby%20McGregor-Smith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ruby McGregor-Smith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of MITIE Group PLC and a member of the House of Lords in the UK.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Young\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Young</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">September 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair of the Board, Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">William L. Young is the Chair of the Board. He is a corporate director and was previously a co-founder and partner of Monitor Clipper Partners.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Young\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Young</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">September 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">William L. Young is the Chair of the Board. He is a corporate director and was previously a co-founder and partner of Monitor Clipper Partners.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ian%20Edwards\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ian Edwards</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">October 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President and Chief Executive Officer of AtkinsRéalis.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mary-Ann%20Bell\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mary-Ann Bell</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Corporate director and former executive at Bell Aliant Regional Communications.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ruby%20McGregor-Smith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ruby McGregor-Smith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former CEO of MITIE Group PLC and a member of the House of Lords in the UK.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Par%C3%A9\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Paré</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">November 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Strategic Advisor at Fasken Martineau DuMoulin LLP.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.atkinsrealis.com/en/about/leadership-and-governance/executive-committee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">AtkinsRéalis Executive Committee Website</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.atkinsrealis.com/en/about/leadership-and-governance/board-of-directors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">AtkinsRéalis Board of Directors Website</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-05-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.atkinsrealis.com/~/media/Files/A/Atkins-Realis/documents/investors/financial-reports/2024/management-proxy-circular-2024-en.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">2024 Management Proxy Circular</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-21)</span></li></ul>"
